sequenceDiagram
    participant KServe as KServe Agent
    participant MMesh as ModelMesh Agent
    participant Dashboard as RHOAI Dashboard
    participant KRBP as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP TLS
    participant TrustyAI as TrustyAI Service<br/>8080/TCP (loopback)
    participant Scheduler as Prometheus Scheduler<br/>(asyncio background)
    participant PVC as PVC Storage<br/>HDF5 Files
    participant MariaDB as MariaDB<br/>3306/TCP TLS
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus<br/>Scraper

    Note over KServe,MariaDB: Flow 1: KServe V2 Inference Data Ingestion

    KServe->>KRBP: POST / (CloudEvent)<br/>HTTPS/8443, Bearer Token
    KRBP->>TrustyAI: POST / (forwarded)<br/>HTTP/8080 loopback, trusted
    TrustyAI->>TrustyAI: Gzip decompress<br/>Parse KServe V2 payload<br/>Reconcile input/output pairs

    alt PVC Storage Mode
        TrustyAI->>PVC: Write HDF5 datasets<br/>Local I/O
    else MariaDB Storage Mode
        TrustyAI->>MariaDB: INSERT inference data<br/>3306/TCP, TLS (optional)<br/>Username/Password
    end

    TrustyAI-->>KRBP: 200 OK
    KRBP-->>KServe: 200 OK

    Note over MMesh,MariaDB: Flow 1b: ModelMesh Protobuf Ingestion

    MMesh->>KRBP: POST /consumer/kserve/v2<br/>HTTPS/8443, Bearer Token
    KRBP->>TrustyAI: POST /consumer/kserve/v2<br/>HTTP/8080 loopback
    TrustyAI->>TrustyAI: Decode base64 protobuf<br/>Parse grpc_predict_v2.proto<br/>Stage partial payload
    TrustyAI->>TrustyAI: Reconcile when<br/>input+output pair complete

    alt PVC Storage Mode
        TrustyAI->>PVC: Write reconciled data
    else MariaDB Storage Mode
        TrustyAI->>MariaDB: INSERT reconciled data
    end

    TrustyAI-->>KRBP: 200 OK
    KRBP-->>MMesh: 200 OK

    Note over Scheduler,Prometheus: Flow 2: Scheduled Metric Computation

    loop Every N seconds (default 30s)
        Scheduler->>Scheduler: Check MetricsDirectory<br/>for registered metrics

        alt PVC Storage Mode
            Scheduler->>PVC: Read inference data<br/>Local I/O
        else MariaDB Storage Mode
            Scheduler->>MariaDB: SELECT inference data<br/>3306/TCP
        end

        Scheduler->>Scheduler: Compute metrics<br/>(SPD, DIR, KS, t-test, mean)
        Scheduler->>Scheduler: Update Prometheus gauges<br/>via PrometheusPublisher
    end

    Prometheus->>KRBP: GET /q/metrics<br/>HTTPS/8443, Bearer Token
    KRBP->>TrustyAI: GET /q/metrics<br/>HTTP/8080 loopback
    TrustyAI-->>KRBP: OpenMetrics text<br/>(trustyai_* gauges)
    KRBP-->>Prometheus: OpenMetrics response

    Note over Dashboard,MariaDB: Flow 3: On-Demand Metric Computation

    Dashboard->>KRBP: POST /metrics/group/fairness/spd<br/>HTTPS/8443, Bearer Token
    KRBP->>TrustyAI: POST /metrics/group/fairness/spd<br/>HTTP/8080 loopback

    alt PVC Storage Mode
        TrustyAI->>PVC: Read inference data
    else MariaDB Storage Mode
        TrustyAI->>MariaDB: SELECT inference data
    end

    TrustyAI->>TrustyAI: Compute SPD metric
    TrustyAI-->>KRBP: JSON response<br/>(metric value + metadata)
    KRBP-->>Dashboard: JSON response
